If you've never made a delegation from your address you can skip this section. However, if you're unsure how many existing delegations you have, you'll want to run the following JavaScript code snippet to get `delegationCount` from within [Polkadot.js](https://polkadot.js.org/apps/?rpc=wss://wss.api.moonbase.moonbeam.network#/js):

